# 统一行尾与文本属性（STD-CODE-04）
# 默认：自动识别文本 + 仓库内统一 LF，消除 Windows/Linux 行尾抖动
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 批处理与 PowerShell 脚本：CRLF（兼容 Windows PowerShell 5.1）
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制：禁止行尾转换与 diff
*.jar binary
*.war binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
*.doc binary
*.docx binary
